  "question": {
    "text": "If $(2+i)$ and $(\\sqrt{5}-2 i)$ are the roots of the equation $\\left(x^{2}+a x+b\\right)\\left(x^{2}+c x+d\\right)=0$ where $a, b, c$ and $d$ are real constants, then product of all the roots of the equation is",
